# Atom Compiler Backend Implementation - COMPLETED

## Overview
Successfully created a full compiler backend for Atom including IR, typechecker, and Cranelift code generation.

## Architecture
- Input: S-Expression AST files (using atom-ast crate deserialization) ✅
- Output: Native object files via Cranelift ✅
- Components: IR, Type Checker, Cranelift Backend ✅
- Error handling: Fail-fast on first error ✅

