## Deliverables
1. ✅ atom-backend crate with complete compiler pipeline
2. ✅ CLI tool (atom-compile) for compiling S-Expression ASTs
3. ✅ Comprehensive test suite
4. ✅ Full documentation (README + inline docs)
5. ✅ Clean, well-organized code following project standards

## Notes
- Error reporting is simple and fail-fast as requested
- Uses only atom-ast (not atom-parser) as requested
- Parallel subagents were used for IR, types, typechecker, codegen, and lowering
- All code thoroughly tested
- Project well organized with clear separation of concerns

